  "title": "Orange Coconut Salmon",
  "description": "Surprise your taste buds with an exciting new preparation for salmon! Marinated in orange juice, encrusted with coconut, and served with a sweet, spicy dipping sauce, salmon never tasted so great.",
  "authors": [
    "Ellen"
  ],
